et":"#LIGHT_BLUE#随机Boss数据错误：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"711af9e4712564ff2d3dd1076eaa03ce95219cd5152f127c0d91fd59f47b3a14","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"67dc3afd3da0f5022787f67a251f2702b7bc4376b00df0c317b06bbcf1873af1","logical_entry_identity":"19316834f7157bcfe37fbd01dfd3b7ef9f80369b5962b63c7c6f5041f0235015","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A young girl with skin pale as snow. She is small, but deadly in battle, unleashing a constant barrage of ice shards.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位有着雪白肌肤的年轻女孩。虽然她很小，但却擅长战斗，她可以在战斗中射出密集的冰箭。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2ff1832298445279b13fd8b3bff4dd0bc47d390f295d79cb5e670e23d80c2446","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"67dcc482ab4db8c507d9a8a66c90a33e8b1cab47b13ac44acbdf1212c1c476ac","logical_entry_identity":"1d916bf7fec0ff11e652801ce58e09cee4e7051159f119a92d7c51808afb25e7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Voice of Telos","source_tag":"entity name","target":"泰勒斯之声"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e827ca53213abf0cf5fa5d179514500827cadec432ef0d207085f85df24af74f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"67e3118196f555bb92cf359c03347079c077f57549e338cb67f1a89922eb5a8f","logical_entry_identity":"45545f3d5e9fde71684c50b68753b6642eb5c0726d5e217ac7e570cf32c1a26a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*A tall man, glowing like a star, appears out of nowhere.*#WHITE#\nOh no, another *adventurer*! You should not mess with things beyond your comprehension!\nDo not meddle in the affairs of Time, for it passes swiftly and is easily disrupted!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*He looks at you more closely.*#WHITE#\nYou seem capable. Help me, fight the abominations while I repair the timeline. It is your only way out!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*一个高大的男人，全身像星星一样闪耀着光芒，在你面前出现了。*#WHITE#\n噢，不，又来了一个“冒险家”！你不该插手超出你理解范围的事物！\n不要搅进有关时间的事物里，时间流逝非常快，而且很容易被搅乱！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他更仔细地端详着你。*#WHITE#\n你看上去很强，帮帮我，在我修理时间线的时候帮我干掉那些憎恶，只有这样你才能离开这里！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator